@startuml state-order
!include style.iuml
title State diagram - Order (OrderStatus)

state PREPARING WAITC
state READY WAITC
state SERVED
state PAID GOODC
state CANCELLED BADC

PREPARING : Chef advances one unit per turn
READY : served next turn at the earliest

[*] --> PREPARING : new Order(customer, item, price, turn)\n(Waiter takes the order; price locked)
PREPARING --> PREPARING : prepareOneUnit(turn)\n[units left > 1]
PREPARING --> READY : prepareOneUnit(turn)\n[last unit] / readyTurn = turn
READY --> SERVED : markServed()\n[readyTurn < turn]
SERVED --> PAID : markPaid()\n(Cashier collects the bill)
PREPARING --> CANCELLED : cancel()\n[customer left]
READY --> CANCELLED : cancel()\n[customer left]
PAID --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
@enduml
